{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 10309806211466257509,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "ECP5 evaluation board - Tutorial",
      "source_hash": 5782580590560708282,
      "context_hash": 9145965619777566612,
      "translation": "ECP5 평가 보드 - 튜토리얼",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162140Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "![](Images/ecp5_evn.jpg)",
      "source_hash": 11632208525808057492,
      "context_hash": 18268817781483165040,
      "translation": "![](Images/ecp5_evn.jpg)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162141Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This tutorial will show you how to install FPGA development tools, synthesize a RISC-V core, compile and install programs and run them on a ECP5 evaluation board.",
      "source_hash": 2335375780683382869,
      "context_hash": 13634940620798951461,
      "translation": "이 튜토리얼은 FPGA 개발 도구를 설치하고, RISC-V 코어를 합성하고, 프로그램을 컴파일 및 설치하여 ECP5 평가 보드에서 실행하는 방법을 보여줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RISC-V": "RISC-V",
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162141Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Install open-source FPGA development toolchain",
      "source_hash": 5572138394935509058,
      "context_hash": 8419064935735875444,
      "translation": "오픈소스 FPGA 개발 툴체인 설치",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162141Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Before starting, you will need to install the open-source FPGA development toolchain (Yosys, NextPNR etc...), instructions to do so are given [here](toolchain.md).",
      "source_hash": 7045063336094331760,
      "context_hash": 230892213567176909,
      "translation": "시작하기 전에, 오픈소스 FPGA 개발 툴체인(Yosys, NextPNR 등)을 설치해야 합니다. 설치 방법은 [여기](toolchain.md)에 나와 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162141Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configure femtosoc and femtorv32",
      "source_hash": 3394444599597584032,
      "context_hash": 1137764836789601359,
      "translation": "femtosoc와 femtorv32 설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162141Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Time to edit `learn-fpga/FemtoRV/RTL/femtosoc_config.v`.",
      "source_hash": 17088278263423589554,
      "context_hash": 12954617796894016229,
      "translation": "이제 `learn-fpga/FemtoRV/RTL/femtosoc_config.v`를 편집할 차례입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162141Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This file lets you define what type of RISC-V processor you will create, and which device drivers in the associated system-on-chip.",
      "source_hash": 4472338690840904927,
      "context_hash": 8808326349786630043,
      "translation": "이 파일을 통해 어떤 종류의 RISC-V 프로세서를 만들지, 그리고 관련 시스템온칩에 어떤 장치 드라이버를 사용할지 정의할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RISC-V": "RISC-V"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162142Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "For now we activate the LEDs (for visual debugging) and the UART (to talk with the system through a terminal-over-USB connection).",
      "source_hash": 6415893910803465986,
      "context_hash": 1490143893719875600,
      "translation": "지금은 LED(시각적 디버깅용)와 UART(터미널-USB 연결을 통해 시스템과 통신)를 활성화합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162142Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "We use 256 Kbytes of RAM.",
      "source_hash": 3326145114271545886,
      "context_hash": 16681068707568936316,
      "translation": "RAM 256KB를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162142Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:4",
      "source": "It is not very much, but for now I'm not able to use the DRAM on the ULX3S (but plan to integrate @sylefeb's SLICE memory controller).",
      "source_hash": 7038579542442008644,
      "context_hash": 15432884055189208508,
      "translation": "그다지 많은 용량은 아니지만, 지금은 ULX3S의 DRAM을 사용할 수 없습니다(다만 @sylefeb의 SLICE 메모리 컨트롤러를 통합할 계획입니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162142Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:5",
      "source": "You will see that with 256kb of RAM, you can still program nice and interesting RISC-V demos.",
      "source_hash": 2460979138831638112,
      "context_hash": 4962493792411122166,
      "translation": "256KB의 RAM만으로도 여전히 멋지고 흥미로운 RISC-V 데모를 프로그래밍할 수 있음을 보게 될 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RISC-V": "RISC-V"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162142Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "We configure `FemtoRV/RTL/femtosoc_config.v` as follows (we keep unused options as commented-out lines):",
      "source_hash": 575862914069925161,
      "context_hash": 3492719893626050524,
      "translation": "`FemtoRV/RTL/femtosoc_config.v`를 다음과 같이 설정합니다(사용하지 않는 옵션은 주석 처리된 줄로 남겨 둡니다):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162142Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Examples",
      "source_hash": 2926230321239078022,
      "context_hash": 11259496904591817737,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162142Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "First you need to generate a program.",
      "source_hash": 14237034096733071914,
      "context_hash": 5053610202719251465,
      "translation": "먼저 프로그램을 생성해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162142Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Let us start with a simple blinker (not very exciting, it will be better after):",
      "source_hash": 9329091213811972124,
      "context_hash": 2789382164580365105,
      "translation": "간단한 블링커부터 시작해 봅시다(그다지 흥미롭지는 않지만, 이후에는 더 나아질 것입니다):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162142Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "You can now synthesize the design and send it to the device.",
      "source_hash": 15295314749018716492,
      "context_hash": 3481420787154569238,
      "translation": "이제 설계를 합성하여 장치로 전송할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162143Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Plug the device in a USB port, then:",
      "source_hash": 1354320448998385023,
      "context_hash": 11918017572888705600,
      "translation": "장치를 USB 포트에 꽂은 다음:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162143Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The first time you run it, it will download RISC-V development tools (takes a while).",
      "source_hash": 2264607628352352897,
      "context_hash": 320603147747008098,
      "translation": "처음 실행할 때는 RISC-V 개발 도구를 다운로드하므로 시간이 좀 걸립니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RISC-V": "RISC-V"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162143Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Examples with the OLED screen",
      "source_hash": 17584475959086831990,
      "context_hash": 5165541346426781112,
      "translation": "OLED 화면 예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162143Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "![](Images/SSD1351_on_ECP5_EVN.jpg)",
      "source_hash": 9091231741994224262,
      "context_hash": 9928359364535317994,
      "translation": "![](Images/SSD1351_on_ECP5_EVN.jpg)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162143Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Let us generate fancy graphics.",
      "source_hash": 922518297174208156,
      "context_hash": 4070795314701003890,
      "translation": "멋진 그래픽을 생성해 봅시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162143Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "For this, you will need a _SSD1351 128x128 oled display_.",
      "source_hash": 12723506953995795483,
      "context_hash": 14744497710792910371,
      "translation": "이를 위해서는 *SSD1351 128x128 oled display*가 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162143Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "It costs around $15 (there exists cheaper screens, such as 240x240 IPS screens driven by the ST7789, but they really do not look as good, and they are not compatible, believe me the SSD1351 is worth the price).",
      "source_hash": 10459967741786388862,
      "context_hash": 11965882620740392730,
      "translation": "가격은 약 $15입니다(ST7789로 구동되는 240x240 IPS 화면처럼 더 저렴한 화면도 있지만, 실제로는 그다지 보기 좋지 않고 호환도 되지 않습니다. 정말이지 SSD1351은 그 가격을 지불할 가치가 있습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162143Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:3",
      "source": "Make sure you get one of good quality (if it costs less than $5 then I'd be suspicious, some users reported failures with such low-cost versions).",
      "source_hash": 12099171432106041380,
      "context_hash": 15536284034133490385,
      "translation": "반드시 품질이 좋은 제품을 구매하십시오($5 미만이라면 의심스럽습니다. 일부 사용자들은 그런 저가 버전에서 불량이 발생했다고 보고했습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162143Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:4",
      "source": "Got mine from Waveshare.",
      "source_hash": 6894590271857558669,
      "context_hash": 8437728740341935739,
      "translation": "저는 Waveshare에서 구매했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162144Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:5",
      "source": "Those from Adafruit were reported to work as well.",
      "source_hash": 8739093410193658445,
      "context_hash": 14518707805465694403,
      "translation": "Adafruit 제품도 정상 작동한다는 보고가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162144Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Connect the wires.",
      "source_hash": 7929305735268355128,
      "context_hash": 2817388720488709454,
      "translation": "배선을 연결하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162144Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "You may change pin assignment if you want, by editing `ecp5_evn.lpf`.",
      "source_hash": 10502269614896303064,
      "context_hash": 5263229573060069399,
      "translation": "`ecp5_evn.lpf`를 편집하여 원하는 경우 핀 배치를 변경할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162144Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "Default configuration is as follows:",
      "source_hash": 9009391233249516499,
      "context_hash": 17330563195091159770,
      "translation": "기본 설정은 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162144Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "OLED display pin name",
      "source_hash": 6526642154658596927,
      "context_hash": 4334360856280816186,
      "translation": "OLED 화면 핀 이름",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:17.162144Z",
